# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# KARAHOCA frontend env template (web/Dockerfile — nginx + Vite SPA)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every variable here is read by `vite build` and INLINED into the static
# bundle. Changing a value requires rebuilding the image — there is no
# runtime config for the SPA.
#
# In Coolify: pass these as **Build Time** variables on the karahoca-web
# service (NOT runtime). The browser never reads process.env directly;
# Vite swaps `import.meta.env.VITE_*` for the literal string at build.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Required ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public URL of the API service. The SPA prefixes every fetch with this.
# Production:        https://api.karahoca.com
# Local development: http://localhost:5000
VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://api.karahoca.com

# ─── Analytics (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID — format: G-XXXXXXXXXX.
# Get yours at https://analytics.google.com/.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# GA4 property ID for the admin dashboard's analytics widget.
# Number only, e.g. 123456789 (NOT "properties/123456789").
VITE_GA_PROPERTY_ID=

# ─── Error tracking (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sentry browser SDK is loaded only when DSN is set, so leaving these empty
# is a zero-cost no-op. The traces sample rate accepts a float 0.0–1.0.
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
VITE_SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=0.1

# Stamped onto Sentry events as the release tag (e.g. git short SHA).
VITE_APP_VERSION=

# ─── CDN override (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When set, /Catalog/*.pdf and /Catalog/*-pages/*.webp are loaded from this
# host instead of the SPA origin. Leave empty to serve from the same nginx
# image. The client helper in src/utils/catalogUrls.ts normalises trailing
# slashes, so both "https://cdn.karahoca.com/" and "…com" work.
VITE_CATALOG_BASE_URL=
